Background
Goals
Styling instructions (e.g., “Respond in a casual, enthusiastic tone”)
This requires modifying WebVoyager’s prompt template — likely in prompt.py or similar.
✅ Component 3: Styling Engine (Optional Enhancement)
If you want real-time stylistic output, you can:
Pass the agent’s raw thoughts/actions to a styling LLM (e.g., TinyTroupe’s model) to rephrase.
Or, inject stylistic instructions into the system prompt (simpler, less compute-heavy).
